  "body": "Experience resort-style living in this beautifully presented two-bedroom apartment, perfectly positioned for sun within a secure, gated complex offering the ultimate coastal lifestyle.\r\nSurrounded by lush subtropical gardens and boasting fantastic shared amenities including an inground swimming pool, tennis courts, and petanque, you'll feel like you're on holiday all year round.\r\nSituated on the sought-after middle level in one of the best locations within the complex, this sun-drenched apartment enjoys uninterrupted park and lake views from its expansive wrap-around decks. Relax, entertain, and soak up the peaceful surroundings from the comfort of your own home.\r\nDesigned for effortless, low-maintenance living, this property is ideal for first-home buyers, downsizers, investors, or anyone seeking the perfect lock-up-and-leave retreat.\r\nLocated in the heart of Gulf Harbour, you'll enjoy the convenience of being just a short stroll from schools, parks, cafés, restaurants, shops, and local amenities. Beautiful beaches, boating, fishing, golf courses, and scenic coastal walkways are all within easy reach.\r\nCommuting couldn't be easier, with public transport on your doorstep, regular ferry services providing a relaxing trip into Auckland's CBD, and the upcoming Penlink connection set to further enhance access to the wider region while supporting future growth.\r\nWhether you're looking for a permanent home, a weekend escape, or a smart investment, this apartment offers an exceptional lifestyle in a great location.\r\nDon't miss this opportunity. If you've been dreaming of resort-style living with everything at your fingertips then call me today to arrange your private viewing.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.\r\n\r\nTo view or download property documents copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/M32Q",
